# Deliberately empty: pnpm 12 reads only registry and auth settings from
# `.npmrc` (https://pnpm.io/settings); every other setting lives in
# `pnpm-workspace.yaml`. A toolchain pin written here would be ignored.
#
# The pins live in `.nvmrc` and `package.json` (engines, devEngines,
# packageManager) for Node/pnpm, and per component in `apps/mobile/.fvmrc`,
# `apps/mobile/pubspec.yaml`, `packages/crypto_dart/pubspec.yaml`,
# `server/caldav/composer.json` and `apps/mobile/android/`.
